load @term/seed/code/group
  find group

# The symplectic group: the linear maps preserving a symplectic form, an antisymmetric pairing, the symmetries of phase
# space in mechanics where position and momentum pair up. It is the classical group of the C family of Dynkin diagrams.
# The form carries the underlying group; preserving the symplectic form is the defining condition.
form symplectic-group
  link group, like group
